    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "Mathematics has always been a subject I find intriguing but not my strongest suit. I enjoy its logic and problem-solving aspects, though I prefer applying it in real-world contexts like cooking or engineering rather than abstract theory. It’s a tool I use, not a passion I pursue deeply.",
